{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">. Punctuation</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310409","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/Punctuation_2.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/Punctuation_2.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"Punctuation_2\" role=\"article\"> \n <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">. Punctuation</h1> \n  \n <div class=\"body refbody\"> \n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"Punctuation_2__section_N10033_N10030_N10001\"> \n   <p class=\"p\">The period (.) symbol ends all statements, including block header statements. The DO, FOR, and REPEAT statements can end with a period or a colon. </p> \n   <p class=\"p\">It is also serves as a separator between:</p> \n   <ul class=\"ul\"> \n    <li class=\"li\">A filename and a filename extension (suffix) in most operating system platforms, for example, <span class=\"ph filepath\">\n      Letter.txt\n     </span></li> \n    <li class=\"li\">The elements of a qualified database table or buffer field name, for example, <code class=\"ph codeph\">\n      Customer.CustNum\n     </code> or <code class=\"ph codeph\">\n      Sports2000.Customer\n     </code> or <code class=\"ph codeph\">\n      Sports2000.Customer.CustNum\n     </code></li> \n    <li class=\"li\">The elements of an ABL package name or .NET namespace, for example, <code class=\"ph codeph\">\n      Progress.Lang\n     </code>, <code class=\"ph codeph\">\n      Progress.Windows\n     </code>, or <code class=\"ph codeph\">\n      System.Collections\n     </code></li> \n    <li class=\"li\">An ABL package or .NET namespace and the name of a class or interface defined in that package or namespace, for example, <code class=\"ph codeph\">\n      Progress.Lang.Error\n     </code>, <code class=\"ph codeph\">\n      Progress.Windows.Form\n     </code>, or <code class=\"ph codeph\">\n      System.Collections.SortedList\n     </code></li> \n   </ul> \n   <p class=\"p\">See <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Punctuation_5.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Punctuation_5.html\">: Punctuation</a> for rules to help you decide whether to use period, colon, or double colon syntax.</p> \n  </section> \n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"Punctuation_2__see-also_GC15O2678548\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d474171e156\">See also</h2> \n    \n   <p class=\"p\"> <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Punctuation_5.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Punctuation_5.html\">: Punctuation</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Punctuation.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Punctuation.html\">:: Punctuation</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Type-name-syntax.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Type-name-syntax.html\">Type-name syntax</a></p> \n  </section> \n </div> \n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Punctuation.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Punctuation.html\">:: Punctuation</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Punctuation_3.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Punctuation_3.html\">; Punctuation</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310409","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1412,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":". Punctuation","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Punctuation_2.html","type":"Manual"}